{title: New Anointing}
{key: G}
{x_theme: grace-mercy, holy-spirit}
{x_source: chrd:new_anointing.chrd}

{comment: Verse 1}
Lord we [C]hunger for your presence
To [Bb/G]know your power and grace
We [Am]humbly seek your mercies as we [D]call upon your [G]name
In our [Bb/G]hearts there is a stirring
There is a [Am]yearning day and night
Till you [Dm]bring a new [C/E]anointing we just [Dm]won't be [G]satisfied

{comment: Chorus}
Lord we [F]need a new [F/Db]anoin - [C]ting
